      "english": "They returned safely.",
      "sense_numbers": [
        1
      ],
      "has_audio": false,
      "notes": null
    },
    {
      "id": "31750_kikan_ex2",
      "japanese": "⟦{宇宙飛行士|うちゅうひこうし}→宇宙飛行士：28176_uchuuhikoushi⟧⟦が→が：00051_ga⟧⟦{地球|ちきゅう}→地球：03461_chikyuu⟧⟦に→に：00314_ni⟧{帰還|きかん}⟦した→する：00392_suru⟧。",
      "english": "The astronaut returned to Earth.",
      "sense_numbers": [
