  "notes": "A formal word. An ordinary trip home is ⟦{帰|かえ}る→帰る：00508_kaeru⟧, or ⟦{帰国|きこく}→帰国：03025_kikoku⟧ for returning to one's country.\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- ⟦{無事|ぶじ}→無事：01602_buji⟧⟦に→に：00314_ni⟧{帰還|きかん}⟦する→する：00392_suru⟧: to return safely\n- ⟦{地球|ちきゅう}→地球：03461_chikyuu⟧⟦に→に：00314_ni⟧{帰還|きかん}⟦する→する：00392_suru⟧: to return to Earth\n- {帰還兵|きかんへい}: returning soldier\n- {帰還困難区域|きかんこんなんくいき}: a zone residents cannot yet return to (after the 2011 Fukushima nuclear accident)\n\nSIMILAR WORDS:\n- ⟦{帰国|きこく}→帰国：03025_kikoku⟧: returning to one's own country; the everyday word\n- ⟦{生還|せいかん}→生還：13566_seikan⟧: coming back alive from a life-threatening situation",
